WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.330
July 20, 1969: humans walk on the Moon.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:11.710
Half a century later, the team from Arequipa looks up at the same Moon.

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:18.070
From jokes to morning TV. Now everyone expects more.

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:25.180
Between the Earth and the Moon there are quiet points, where gravity balances.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:31.450
Getting there is chaos: two paths that start almost the same end up worlds apart.

00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.460
<v Roberto>Out here, small mistakes don't stay small.

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:41.530
Their payload: a telescope with a golden mirror, to see the oldest light.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:47.580
A real one has worked since 2022 near a quiet point of the Sun and the Earth.

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:55.950
The investors are nervous. One small error and the route is lost. The budget says the same.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:00.810
Choose the route. Respect the chaos.

